 열려도 데이터 꼬임 없는 브라우저 락","date":"2026.10.17.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/473b7/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png","srcSet":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/be4d9/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 192w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/5fc50/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 384w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/473b7/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 768w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/13e83/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/b3234/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 192w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/65a7c/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 384w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/30053/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 768w,\n/static/77d3533f77052c140bf796fc9c859f68/87027/web-locks-api-concurrency-control.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"a47ad06b-7758-5e99-a44f-1dacd3c2157a","fields":{"slug":"/webassembly_webgpu_trend_story/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🚀 브라우저 안의 혁명: WebAssembly + WebGPU로 여는 고성능 웹의 미래","summary":"🌐 Prologue: 브라우저는 더 이상 단순한 문서 뷰어가 아니다","date":"2025.08.06.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/473b7/WebGPU.png","srcSet":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/be4d9/WebGPU.png 192w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/5fc50/WebGPU.png 384w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/473b7/WebGPU.png 768w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b30